<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Greenline Landscaping — Lawn Care & Landscape Design</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --forest:#173125;
    --forest-deep:#0f2118;
    --cream:#f6f4ec;
    --moss:#7ea154;
    --moss-light:#a9c97e;
    --soil:#5a4632;
    --gold:#c8992e;
    --line:#2a4636;
    --text-dim:#6b7a70;
  }
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    color:var(--forest-deep);
    background:var(--cream);
    line-height:1.6;
  }
  .display{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;}
  a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit;}
  img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
  .wrap{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}

  /* NAV */
  nav{
    position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:var(--cream);
    border-bottom:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.12);
  }
  nav .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:76px;}
  .logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
  .logo .mark{
    width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--forest);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--moss-light);font-size:18px;
  }
  .navlinks{display:flex;gap:32px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;color:var(--forest-deep);}
  .navlinks a{opacity:0.75;transition:opacity .2s;}
  .navlinks a:hover{opacity:1;}
  .nav-cta{
    background:var(--forest);color:var(--cream);padding:11px 20px;border-radius:6px;
    font-size:14px;font-weight:600;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover{background:var(--forest-deep);}

  /* HERO — lawn stripe motif */
  .hero{
    position:relative;
    background:
      repeating-linear-gradient(115deg,
        rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 0px, rgba(255,255,255,0.05) 46px,
        transparent 46px, transparent 92px),
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--forest) 0%, var(--forest-deep) 100%);
    color:var(--cream);
    padding:64px 0 0;
    overflow:hidden;
  }
  .hero-inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 0.85fr;gap:40px;align-items:center;padding-bottom:64px;}
  .badge{
    display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;background:rgba(169,201,126,0.14);
    border:1px solid rgba(169,201,126,0.35);color:var(--moss-light);
    font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:22px;
  }
  h1.hero-title{font-size:48px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.01em;max-width:520px;}
  .hero-title .accent{color:var(--moss-light);}
  .hero-sub{margin-top:18px;font-size:16px;color:rgba(246,244,236,0.75);max-width:440px;}
  .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:30px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn-gold{
    background:var(--gold);color:var(--forest-deep);padding:14px 26px;border-radius:6px;
    font-weight:600;font-size:14px;
  }
  .btn-gold:hover{background:#dba93a;}
  .btn-outline{
    border:1px solid rgba(246,244,236,0.35);color:var(--cream);padding:14px 26px;border-radius:6px;
    font-weight:600;font-size:14px;
  }
  .btn-outline:hover{border-color:var(--cream);}
  .hero-stats{display:flex;gap:28px;margin-top:40px;}
  .hero-stats div{border-left:2px solid var(--moss);padding-left:12px;}
  .hero-stats .n{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;}
  .hero-stats .l{font-size:12px;color:rgba(246,244,236,0.6);}

  .hero-visual{
    position:relative;height:380px;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;
    background:linear-gradient(160deg,#4a6b3a,#2d4523);
    border:1px solid rgba(169,201,126,0.25);
  }
  .hero-visual::before{
    content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;
    background:repeating-linear-gradient(100deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0 22px, transparent 22px 44px);
  }
  .hero-visual-label{
    position:absolute;bottom:18px;left:18px;background:rgba(15,33,24,0.7);
    color:var(--cream);font-size:12px;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;
    font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;backdrop-filter:blur(4px);
  }

  /* SECTIONS */
  section{padding:80px 0;}
  .sec-eyebrow{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--moss);letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px;}
  .sec-title{font-size:32px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-0.01em;max-width:520px;}
  .sec-sub{color:var(--text-dim);margin-top:12px;max-width:480px;font-size:15px;}

  /* SERVICES */
  .services-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:44px;}
  .service-card{
    background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.1);border-radius:12px;
    padding:26px 22px;transition:transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }
  .service-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(23,49,37,0.08);}
  .service-icon{
    width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--forest);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--moss-light);
    font-size:19px;margin-bottom:16px;
  }
  .service-card h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .service-card p{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--text-dim);}

  /* GALLERY (before/after) */
  .gallery-strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px;margin-top:44px;}
  .gallery-item{border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.1);}
  .gallery-photo{
    height:180px;position:relative;
    background:linear-gradient(135deg,#dfe8d4,#c3d6ae);
  }
  .gallery-photo.after{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a6b3a,#2d4523);}
  .gallery-tag{
    position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
    padding:4px 10px;border-radius:20px;letter-spacing:0.04em;
  }
  .gallery-tag.before{background:#fff;color:var(--forest-deep);}
  .gallery-tag.after{background:var(--gold);color:var(--forest-deep);}
  .gallery-caption{padding:14px 16px;background:#fff;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-dim);}

  /* TESTIMONIALS */
  .testimonial-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;margin-top:44px;}
  .t-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:26px;}
  .t-stars{color:var(--gold);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:14px;letter-spacing:2px;}
  .t-card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--forest-deep);margin-bottom:18px;}
  .t-name{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}
  .t-loc{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-dim);}

  /* PROCESS */
  .process-band{background:var(--forest);color:var(--cream);}
  .process-band .sec-eyebrow{color:var(--moss-light);}
  .process-band .sec-title{color:var(--cream);}
  .process-steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:0;margin-top:44px;}
  .p-step{padding-right:22px;border-right:1px solid rgba(246,244,236,0.15);}
  .p-step:last-child{border-right:none;}
  .p-num{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:var(--moss-light);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .p-step h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .p-step p{font-size:13px;color:rgba(246,244,236,0.65);}

  /* CONTACT */
  .contact-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:48px;margin-top:44px;align-items:start;}
  .info-row{display:flex;gap:14px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.1);}
  .info-row .ico{width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--forest);color:var(--moss-light);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:15px;flex-shrink:0;}
  .info-row h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px;}
  .info-row p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-dim);}
  form{background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.1);border-radius:12px;padding:28px;}
  .f-row{margin-bottom:16px;}
  .f-row label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:6px;color:var(--forest-deep);}
  .f-row input, .f-row textarea{
    width:100%;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.15);border-radius:6px;
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14px;background:var(--cream);
  }
  .f-row textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:80px;}
  .f-submit{
    width:100%;background:var(--forest);color:var(--cream);padding:13px;border-radius:6px;
    font-weight:600;font-size:14px;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  }
  .f-submit:hover{background:var(--forest-deep);}

  footer{background:var(--forest-deep);color:rgba(246,244,236,0.6);padding:36px 0;}
  footer .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:13px;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;}
  footer .flinks{display:flex;gap:20px;}

  @media(max-width:860px){
    .hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .hero-visual{height:220px;}
    h1.hero-title{font-size:34px;}
    .services-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
    .gallery-strip{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .testimonial-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .process-steps{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px;}
    .p-step{border-right:none;border-left:2px solid rgba(246,244,236,0.15);padding-left:18px;padding-right:0;}
    .contact-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .navlinks{display:none;}
  }
  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--moss);outline-offset:2px;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){*{transition:none !important;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="logo"><span class="mark">🌿</span> Greenline Landscaping</div>
    <div class="navlinks">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#work">Our Work</a>
      <a href="#reviews">Reviews</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Get a Free Quote</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">
    <div>
      <div class="badge">🌱 Serving the greater metro area since 2014</div>
      <h1 class="hero-title display">Lawn care your <span class="accent">neighbors will notice.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Weekly mowing, seasonal landscaping, and irrigation care for homes and small businesses — done by a local crew, not a call center.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn-gold" href="#contact">Get a Free Quote →</a>
        <a class="btn-outline" href="#work">See Our Work</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div><div class="n">11 yrs</div><div class="l">In business</div></div>
        <div><div class="n">480+</div><div class="l">Properties served</div></div>
        <div><div class="n">4.9★</div><div class="l">Average rating</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="hero-visual-label">📍 Recent project — Maple Street</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<section id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">What we do</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title display">Full-service lawn & landscape care</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">From a weekly mow to a full yard redesign — one crew, one point of contact, no subcontractors.</p>
    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">✂️</div>
        <h3>Lawn Mowing</h3>
        <p>Weekly or bi-weekly mowing, edging, and cleanup — scheduled around your calendar.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">🌳</div>
        <h3>Tree & Shrub Care</h3>
        <p>Trimming, shaping, and seasonal pruning to keep growth healthy and tidy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">🎨</div>
        <h3>Landscape Design</h3>
        <p>Beds, mulch, and planting plans built around your yard's light and soil.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-card">
        <div class="service-icon">💧</div>
        <h3>Irrigation Setup</h3>
        <p>Sprinkler installation and seasonal tune-ups so nothing goes dry or floods.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="work" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.08);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(23,49,37,0.08);">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Recent projects</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title display">Before & after</h2>
    <p class="sec-sub">A few yards we've turned around this season. Actual client work, shared with permission.</p>
    <div class="gallery-strip">
      <div class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-photo"><span class="gallery-tag before">BEFORE</span></div>
        <div class="gallery-caption">Overgrown front bed → Maple St.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-photo after"><span class="gallery-tag after">AFTER</span></div>
        <div class="gallery-caption">Fresh mulch & border → Maple St.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item">
        <div class="gallery-photo"><span class="gallery-tag before">BEFORE</span></div>
        <div class="gallery-caption">Patchy backyard lawn → Oak Ave.</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="reviews">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Reviews</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title display">What clients say</h2>
    <div class="testimonial-grid">
      <div class="t-card">
        <div class="t-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"Same crew every week, always on time, and my lawn has never looked this even. Easy to recommend."</p>
        <div class="t-name">Sarah M.</div>
        <div class="t-loc">Homeowner, Maple St.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="t-card">
        <div class="t-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"They redesigned our front beds in a weekend and it completely changed how the house looks from the street."</p>
        <div class="t-name">David R.</div>
        <div class="t-loc">Homeowner, Oak Ave.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="t-card">
        <div class="t-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p>"Handles the grounds for our office park. Reliable, communicative, and the property always looks sharp."</p>
        <div class="t-name">Priya K.</div>
        <div class="t-loc">Property Manager</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="process-band">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">How it works</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title display">Getting started is simple</h2>
    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="p-step"><div class="p-num">01</div><h3>Request a quote</h3><p>Tell us your address and what you need — we usually reply same day.</p></div>
      <div class="p-step"><div class="p-num">02</div><h3>Free walkthrough</h3><p>We visit the property and confirm scope and price before anything starts.</p></div>
      <div class="p-step"><div class="p-num">03</div><h3>We get to work</h3><p>Your crew shows up on schedule — no surprises, no upsells.</p></div>
      <div class="p-step"><div class="p-num">04</div><h3>Ongoing care</h3><p>Weekly or seasonal visits keep the property looking sharp year-round.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-eyebrow">Get in touch</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title display">Request your free quote</h2>
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="ico">📞</div>
          <div><h4>Call or text</h4><p>(555) 019-4482</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="ico">✉️</div>
          <div><h4>Email</h4><p>hello@greenlinelandscaping.com</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="ico">📍</div>
          <div><h4>Service area</h4><p>Greater metro area — 20 mile radius</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="ico">🕐</div>
          <div><h4>Hours</h4><p>Mon–Sat, 7am – 6pm</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <form onsubmit="return false;">
        <div class="f-row"><label>Name</label><input type="text" placeholder="Your name"></div>
        <div class="f-row"><label>Phone or email</label><input type="text" placeholder="How we reach you"></div>
        <div class="f-row"><label>What do you need?</label><textarea placeholder="Tell us about your yard..."></textarea></div>
        <button class="f-submit" type="submit">Request Free Quote</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>© 2026 Greenline Landscaping. All rights reserved.</div>
    <div class="flinks">
      <a href="#services">Services</a>
      <a href="#work">Our Work</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
